sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Хэрэглэгч
    participant FE as Фронтенд
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as Database
    participant GM as Gemini

    User->>FE: Тайлан хүсэх
    FE->>API: POST /gemini/analyze
    API->>DB: Query latest posts
    DB-->>API: Return posts
    API->>GM: Send prompt
    GM-->>API: Return report
    API-->>FE: Return report
    FE-->>User: Render report
